    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a bridge between abstract thinking and practical problem-solving for me. As someone who enjoys structured logic but finds it challenging at times, I appreciate its role in both creative and analytical pursuits—like solving equations or analyzing data. It’s a tool that feels both intimidating and rewarding, especially when applied to real-world scenarios like my part-time work or teaching literature.",
