    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly for learning, but I’ve used AI tools like translation apps (e.g., Google Translate) to cross-check my understanding of mathematical terms when studying literature-related concepts. The experience was helpful—it reduced frustration by providing quick clarifications, though it didn’t replace deep practice.",
